<p>General	  1,669/--- (LDD)   ---/331  Pioneer E.	05/01</p>
<p>Sugar	    1,186/--- (LDD) 6,196/---  Hyoksin	   03/01</p>
<p>General	    ---/435 (LDD)   ---/ 29  Tiger Creek     07/01</p>
<p>General	    ---/322 (LDD)   ---/128  Atlas Fortune   08/01</p>
